From 028883ac17a02c79887de929ab778a7f5baf9393 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:12:47 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: List event enrollments on a paginated page

Add GET /admin/events/{id}/enrollments (and /page/{page}) handled by
Admin\EnrollmentsController::index, listing name, e-mail and enrollment
date with 5 per page via Event::enrollments()->paginate(). Paginator
gains fixed route params so page links keep the event id, and
Enrollment now stores created_at.
